      "<strong>v1.24.7 &mdash; Agentiport cross-DB sister-data pointer on /app/refill/patients/contacts.</strong> Walk-through 2026-05-28 surfaced that Karen's enriched contacts (815 reachable / 92 already-matched suggestions / 6 banned) live in the Agentiport (Emma OS, openagenticv4 codebase) Supabase project &mdash; NOT refill-prod. The CSV upload predated the Refill spinout; refill-prod inherited the 1,140 patient roster via SQL fixup but the contact-candidates + match state stayed on Agentiport. Pragmatic fix: small amber 'See in Agentiport' link in the page header actions slot pointing at <code>agentiport.com/app/refill/patients/contacts</code>. No hunting next session. Memory written to <code>project_agentiport_refill_cross_db_contacts.md</code> with the A/B fallback strategy: re-upload CSV to refill-prod first (Path B, fast), cross-DB copy preserving match state as the fallback (Path A, harder, only if B doesn't match Agentiport's quality). Touched: <code>src/routes/app.refill.patients.contacts.tsx</code> (Agentiport link in actions), <code>src/lib/changelog.ts</code> (this entry).",
